{"id":"55e4f62f29657a14","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-fixed-point-exists.md","title":"Normal Ordinal Functions Have Unbounded Fixed Points","display":"lem-fixed-point-exists — Normal Ordinal Functions Have Unbounded Fixed Points","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-fixed-point-exists","aliases":["92-lem-fixed-point-exists"],"display":"lem-fixed-point-exists — Normal Ordinal Functions Have Unbounded Fixed Points","depends_on":["[[92-df-normal-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-fixed-point-exists"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-fixed-point-exists</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fixed-point-exists — Normal Ordinal Functions Have Unbounded Fixed Points"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aed464040ce8d4ec\" href=\"?note=aed464040ce8d4ec\" title=\"92-df-normal-function\">92-df-normal-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (total ordinal-valued class function with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\)</span> (normal-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aed464040ce8d4ec\" href=\"?note=aed464040ce8d4ec\" title=\"92-df-normal-function\">92-df-normal-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (lower-bound ordinal)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\n\\bigl(\\gamma&lt;\\beta\\land f(\\beta)=\\beta\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\n\\bigl(\\gamma&lt;\\beta\\land f(\\beta)=\\beta\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\beta)=\\beta\">\\(f(\\beta)=\\beta\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span> 是序数正规函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的固定点</li>\n<li>从任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> 上方开始迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>；若迭代不提前稳定，其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-上确界借助正规函数的连续性成为固定点</li>\n<li>因而固定点类无界；进一步可证明它是闭类</li>\n<li>这里量化的是类函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>为真类，不能把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>误作以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>为定义域的集合函数</li>\n<li>这是序数正规函数的固定点定理，与 Gödel 对角引理中“句子与其变换可证等价”的句法固定点不同</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-normal-function","status":"resolved","id":"aed464040ce8d4ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-normal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-normal-function","status":"resolved","id":"aed464040ce8d4ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Normal}(f)$ (normal-function predicate, see [[92-df-normal-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}exists}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\n\\bigl(\\gamma<\\beta\\land f(\\beta)=\\beta\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"f(\\beta)=\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false}],"bytes":1363,"backlinks":[{"id":"ced07f0d506d2066","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"不要与正规序数函数的序数固定点混淆；后者见 [[92-lem-fixed-point-exists]]"}],"outgoing":["aed464040ce8d4ec"]}